   "stem": {
      "text": "The function D is differentiable, and D(t) gives the distance a runner has covered on a trail, in meters, at time t minutes. Selected values of D(t) are given in the table. Using the average rate of change of D over the interval \\( 2 \\le t \\le 10 \\), approximate \\( D'(4) \\). Give the exact value of the approximation and indicate units of measure.",
